  {
    "id": 7802001070020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "やっとここまで来たのね\r\n今まで以上に頑張らなくちゃ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200107/7802001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、やる気だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001070030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "中途半端なところで敗退なんかできないでしょ\r\n注目だけ浴びて、引き立て役で去るなんてごめんだわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200107/7802001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、大丈夫だよ\r\nかななら大丈夫",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001070040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "また適当に────",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200107/7802001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近、かな自身が楽しんでいる気がして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001070050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200107/7802001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう時が一番輝くんだって……\r\n経験上、知ってるからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001070060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そ、そう……？\r\nプロデューサーが言うならそうかもしれないけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200107/7802001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001070070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そっか、私……そんなふうに見えてるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200107/7802001070070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ここから先は勝ちに行こう\r\n楽しんだもの勝ちだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7802001070080,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "確かに、こういうのは楽しんだほうがいいのかもね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/780200107/7802001070080"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
